      ":question/problem": "![](images/48/48a59cdc092ef2cb25220bb00262ebd79f068a4bf79aa643599eddc42979cd3b.png)\n\nThe manager of a bookstore kept track of how many books each of their regular customers purchased during two different months. This information is displayed using the box plots shown above.\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe range of the number of books purchased during the first month is\n{{field-1}}.\n\nThe range of the number of books purchased during the second month is\n{{field-2}}.\n\nComparing the ranges suggests the dataset for the\n{{field-3}}\nmonth is more spread out."
